{
    "title": "Billiards City - 8 Ball Pool",
    "description": "Ready for a gorgeous billiards adventure in Billiard City?\r\nBilliards City - 8 Ball Pool will bring you a new and amazing experience! If you are a billiards game lover, you will love this game.\r\n\r\nMain feature:\r\n\r\n[Different tables and clubs]\r\nTables come in different shapes and colors, and the number of holes varies; you can also unlock more advanced clubs to help you hit great shots!\r\n\r\n[Awesome gaming experience]\r\nBilliards City uses realistic impact sound and is responsive, giving you a near-real billiards experience.\r\n\r\n[Various challenge levels]\r\nEvery certain number of normal levels, we have prepared interesting challenge levels for you, it may be a little difficult, but I believe you can pass it!\r\n\r\n[Can also play offline]\r\nBilliards City has designed 1000+ levels, which can also be played offline, allowing you to enjoy your billiards adventure anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for ? Come and play Billiards City - 8 Ball Pool and invite friends to play together!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ready for a gorgeous billiards adventure in Billiard City?<br>Billiards City - 8 Ball Pool will bring you a new and amazing experience! If you are a billiards game lover, you will love this game.<br><br>Main feature:<br><br>[Different tables and clubs]<br>Tables come in different shapes and colors, and the number of holes varies; you can also unlock more advanced clubs to help you hit great shots!<br><br>[Awesome gaming experience]<br>Billiards City uses realistic impact sound and is responsive, giving you a near-real billiards experience.<br><br>[Various challenge levels]<br>Every certain number of normal levels, we have prepared interesting challenge levels for you, it may be a little difficult, but I believe you can pass it!<br><br>[Can also play offline]<br>Billiards City has designed 1000+ levels, which can also be played offline, allowing you to enjoy your billiards adventure anytime, anywhere.<br><br>What are you waiting for ? Come and play Billiards City - 8 Ball Pool and invite friends to play together!",
